# Every third-party thing the kind lane installs, pinned. Images are pulled BY DIGEST (the multi-arch index digest, so a laptop and CI take the same content), retagged to the
# tag named here and loaded into the cluster; the manifests use the tag with imagePullPolicy IfNotPresent, so nothing is pulled by the cluster itself.
# `ci/kind/check-pins.sh` (run by the helm workflow on every change under ci/kind/) fails when a manifest, script or values-kind file names an image that is not in
# this list, not built by the lane and not exempt there, or when a line here lacks a digest.
KIND_NODE_IMAGE=kindest/node:v1.33.4@sha256:25a6018e48dfcaee478f4a59af81157a437f15e6e140bf103f85a2e7cd0cbbf2
CERT_MANAGER_CHART=v1.21.2           # https://charts.jetstack.io
CNPG_CHART=0.29.1                    # https://cloudnative-pg.github.io/charts (operator 1.30.1)
# tag|digest, one per line
PINNED_IMAGES="
quay.io/jetstack/cert-manager-cainjector:v1.21.2|sha256:c85268c64f2e0e76684bf5fe8906caff34b82523561c6affe0fae3546bd87562
